@startuml
!include ../drawio-theme.puml

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam backgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam linetype polyline

title 生产级 Agent OS 核心模块架构图（C4 Component）

' 本图表达逻辑组件协作；组件名到 V3 服务、Port 和数据所有权的映射见主设计第 6.1 节。
node "Client Interface" {
  [Web UI / API Gateway] as Gateway
}

rectangle "Agent Kernel System 边界" as KernelBoundary #FFFDF8 {
  package "L1: 统一控制层\n(Control & Orchestration Runtime)" #EAF2F8 {
    [会话管理器\n(Session Manager)] as SessionMgr
    [上下文组装器\n(Context Manager)] as ContextMgr
    [运行调度器\n(Run Scheduler)] as Scheduler
    [运行状态入口\n(Run Registry)] as RunRegistry
    [无状态流程推进器\n(FlowEngine)] as FlowEngine
    [资源管理器\n(Resource Manager)] as ResourceManager
    [拦截器 / PEP\n(Policy Enforcement Point)] as PEP

    database "聚合根持久化\n(State DB)" as DB {
      folder "Sessions"
      folder "Runs"
      folder "Memory"
    }
  }

  package "L2: 认知引擎层\n(Cognitive Runtime)" #FEF9E7 {
    [Agent 核心\n(Agent Loop)] as AgentCore
    [格式解析与纠错\n(Parser)] as Parser
    [Agent Adapter Boundary] as AgentAdapter
  }

  package "Security Plane" #FDEDEC {
    [鉴权中心 / PDP\n(Policy Decision Point)] as PDP
    database "已编译技术策略快照\n(Policy Snapshot)" as PolicyDB
  }

  package "L3: 受控工具执行层\n(Controlled Tool Runtime)" #E9F7EF {
    [工具路由网关\n(Tool Router)] as ToolRouter
  }

  [运维端口\nObservabilityPort] as ObsPort #F3E8FF
  [基础设施端口\nInfrastructurePort] as InfraPort #E5E7EB
}

package "Model Provider 边界" as ModelProviderPlane #FEF9E7 {
  cloud "LLM API\n(GPT / Qwen / 可配置模型)" as LLM
}

package "Tool Provider 边界" as ToolProviderPlane #E9F7EF {
  [内部业务 API\n(微服务 / 外部能力)] as InternalAPI
}

package "L4: 受控执行层\n(Execution Runtime)" #E9F7EF {
  [Tool Provider Adapter] as ToolProviderAdapter
  node "一次性有界沙箱" as Sandbox {
    [Code Interpreter]
  }
}

package "Operations Plane 边界\n（横切运维能力）" as OperationsPlane #F3E8FF {
  [Telemetry Collector] as Telemetry
  [结构化日志 / Trace / 指标 / 健康] as Observability
  [安全审计 / 告警 / 诊断包] as OpsAudit
}

package "Infrastructure Plane 边界\n（只提供机制，不拥有领域规则）" as InfrastructurePlane #E5E7EB {
  [Port Adapter Layer] as InfraAdapter
  node "Container / Process Runtime" as RuntimeInfra
  [IPC / HTTP / SSE / Egress] as TransportInfra
  database "State / Memory / Artifact Storage" as StorageInfra
  [Secret / Clock] as SecretClockInfra
}

Gateway -right-> Scheduler : 1. 发起任务请求\n（可信 ExecutionEnvelopeRef）

Scheduler -down-> SessionMgr : 2. 唤醒 / 创建 Session
Scheduler -right-> RunRegistry : RunSchedulingPort
SessionMgr -right-> DB : 读写持久化状态
RunRegistry -right-> DB : Run / Attempt / Event
SessionMgr -down-> ContextMgr : 3. 提取 Memory 与动态上下文（RAG）

Scheduler -right-> ResourceManager : 4a. ExecutionResourcePort\n申请有界执行槽
ResourceManager -up-> FlowEngine : 4b. 推进已调度 AgentRun
FlowEngine -up-> AgentCore : 4c. 注入 Context 并推进 AgentLoop
AgentCore -right-> AgentAdapter : AgentAdapterPort
AgentAdapter -right-> LLM : BND-MOD-001\nProvider 私有协议
AgentCore -left-> Parser : 解析意图（生成 ToolRequest）
Parser -down-> FlowEngine : 5. 抛出动作候选回主控层

FlowEngine -right-> PEP : 6. 拦截动作，发起鉴权
PEP -up-> PDP : 7. 携带 Context 询问权限
PDP -down-> PolicyDB : 查算策略
PDP .down.> PEP : 8. 返回鉴权结果\n（通过 / 挂起审批）

PEP -right-> ToolRouter : 9. 鉴权通过，下发放行凭证
ToolRouter -right-> ToolProviderAdapter : 10a. ToolProviderPort
ToolProviderAdapter -right-> InternalAPI : Provider 私有协议
ToolRouter -down-> Sandbox : 10b. SandboxPort.execute\n一次性有界执行

ToolRouter .left.> FlowEngine : 10. 返回执行结果写入黑板
FlowEngine .down.> SessionMgr : 11. 提交 ContextDelta / ArtifactRef

' 横切运维只接收 OperationContext 与遥测，不反向控制领域流程。
Scheduler .down.> ObsPort : OperationContext / 调度耗时
ResourceManager .down.> ObsPort : 队列 / 执行槽 / 资源耗时
FlowEngine .down.> ObsPort : 状态推进耗时
AgentCore .down.> ObsPort : AgentLoop / 模型耗时
PEP .down.> ObsPort : 权限判定 / 安全审计
ToolRouter .down.> ObsPort : ToolCall / 沙箱耗时
ObsPort .right.> Telemetry : ObservabilityPort
Telemetry --> Observability : 写入遥测
Telemetry --> OpsAudit : 审计与诊断

' 领域组件只依赖 Port；具体容器、通信、存储、密钥和时钟机制位于 Kernel 之外。
DB --> InfraPort : RepositoryPort
Scheduler --> InfraPort : TransportPort / ClockPort
ResourceManager --> InfraPort : ExecutionResourcePort / ProcessPort
AgentCore --> InfraPort : ModelEgressPort / SecretPort
Sandbox --> InfraPort : Process / Container / Filesystem / Network Port
InfraPort -down-> InfraAdapter : InfrastructurePort
InfraAdapter --> RuntimeInfra : 创建 / 回收隔离机制
InfraAdapter --> TransportInfra
InfraAdapter --> StorageInfra
InfraAdapter --> SecretClockInfra

legend bottom
  本图是逻辑组件视图，不表示代码包、部署单元或聚合所有权。
  FlowEngine 是无状态推进算法；Session 与 Run 权威状态均在 Repository，不在 Engine 内。
  一个 Host 可用一个 FlowEngine 服务多个 Session/Run；Session 不对应进程。
  Multi-agent 团队拓扑、角色和协作由 Agent Kernel System 外的业务编排负责。
  身份 Token 在 Backend/KernelHost 终止；Kernel 不拥有 RBAC/ABAC 权威策略。
  L4 定义受控执行语义；Infrastructure 只实现进程、容器、文件和网络机制。
  运维平面只接收上下文和遥测；基础设施平面只通过 Port 提供机制，二者均不得反向定义领域规则。
endlegend

@enduml
